rusion” cooking method, which uses high heat that unfortunately oxidizes fats in the food.</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="91e984c2-792e-42ca-8721-30892eba1eb8" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-eu9hqz alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Oxidizing fats makes them rancid, and it turns them into “free radicals”—inflammatory molecules that destroy cells in your dog’s body. This is not an alarmist hippy theory. This is basic biochemistry. </span></p></span></div><div data-rid="54aa56e1-adcb-4889-8d0f-f12353542bb5" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1os3p5s alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">Dry kibble is also high in inflammatory omega-6 fats. You’ll be amazed at what can happen to your dog’s health when you switch them to our anti-inflamamtory air dried perfect kibble.</span></p></span></div></div></div><div data-rid="6d8db246-1cfd-4ec4-a601-118d888e43e5" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0" class="r-e7a22a"><div data-rid="d1052611-fa79-4d8d-a331-6408ca84f9ed" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-tptyh4"><div data-rid="8c7906b8-e611-47cb-8e00-eb59e8686802" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1t31qoa alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>Why fresh and raw food don’t work to heal your dog.</p></span></div><div data-rid="1484d7c8-bb80-4fa9-9183-765e778ce4e2" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1fy86bz alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>Many pet parents come to yumwoof after having tried fresh dog food brands or a raw diet—still not seeing health improvements in their dog. The problem with fresh and raw dog food is they’re both high in inflammatory omega-6 fatty acids, and many even include inflammatory seed oils.</p></span></div><div data-rid="befd81a8-1b16-419b-a5ef-dfc669d21895" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0.0" class="r-1u64byd alchem