</section></div><div data-rid="5c2fd854-2a8f-4c9c-8770-d6489c17e607" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0" class="r-1d55xe3"><div data-rid="19474403-c346-49bc-b3ee-0769bec38d10" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-8t43nj alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><h1>EXPLAINED:</h1></span></div><div data-rid="7b335700-70f3-4da7-a8a6-b75daafc030f" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-1uwmmet alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><h1><span style="color: inherit; font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit; letter-spacing: inherit; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: inherit; text-transform: inherit; background-color: transparent;">Why we NEVER USE seed oils</span><br></h1></span></div><div data-rid="edecf57b-4210-4bff-9ca4-f37d2823671d" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0.0" class="r-1qtqicn alchemy-rte"><span contenteditable="false" style="width:100%"><p>Seed oils including sunflower oil, safflower oil and canola oil can cause inflammation in your dog due to their high omega-6 levels.</p><p><br></p><p>They are unfortunately very common in dog food. Check the ingredients label on your dog's food.</p><p><br></p><p>While small amounts of omega-6 fats are necessary, they can be obtained through natural ingredients. Adding seed oils can cause excessive intake of omega-6 versus omega-3, activating inflammatory molecules such as PGE2 and cytokines.</p><p><br></p><p>Another health concern with seed oils is how they're heavily processed, which can strip them of beneficial nutrients and leave behind harmful byproducts.<br></p><p><br></p><p>Bottom line: seed oils are not a necessary or beneficial ingredient, and they may worsen chronic health conditions.</p><p><br></p><p>That's why yumwoof only uses anti-inflammatory fats in our dog food, including the highest levels of omega-3s and coconut oil. We believe it's a key reason why so many dogs have success with our food.</p><p><br></p><p>— Jaron Lukas, founder of yumwoof!</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="f6b42c6f-d2b4-4a5a-b01e-ecb5b939f3da" data-replo-repeated-index=".0.0" class="r-tv4rd5"><section class="money-back">
